{'symbol': 'MS', 'date': '2021-09-23 10:00:00', 'title': 'MORGAN STANLEY AT WORK AND WILSON SONSINI LAUNCH API INTEGRATION TO STREAMLINE THE STARTUP JOURNEY AND BOOST OPEN CAPITALIZATION DATA SHARING', 'text': "NEW YORK & PALO ALTO, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MORGAN STANLEY AT WORK TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS PARTNERED WITH PREMIER TECHNOLOGY LEGAL FIRM WILSON SONSINI GOODRICH & ROSATI TO DEVELOP A NEW APPLICATION PROGRAMMING INTERFACE (“API”) THAT ALLOWS EQUITY INFORMATION FOR MUTUAL CLIENTS TO PASS SEAMLESSLY BETWEEN LAW FIRM AND EQUITY MANAGEMENT PROVIDER. THIS INDUSTRY-FIRST API INTEGRATES MORGAN STANLEY AT WORK'S SHAREWORKS PLATFORM (“SHAREWORKS”) AND WILSON SONSINI'S NEW PROPRIETARY SOFTWARE PLATFO"}